OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F361A1786425556
OL,3,CTrainee officer charged with rape and
OL,4,Ckidnap of woman
OL,6,FAn off-duty officer-in-training has
OL,7,Fbeen charged with a number of offences
OL,8,Fincluding the rape and kidnap of a
OL,9,Fwoman.
OL,11,FMohammed Hassan, a student officer
OL,12,Fwith Greater Manchester Police (GMP),
OL,13,Fhas been charged following a police
OL,14,Fpursuit on the M62 on Saturday 8
OL,15,FAugust 2026.
OL,17,FThe 23-year-old, of Asian-Pakistani
OL,18,Fethnicity, has now been suspended by
OL,19,Fthe force over the alleged offences.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/4
