PN,36102
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F361A1786425556
OL,3,CTrainee officer charged with rape and
OL,4,Ckidnap of woman
OL,6,FHassan has been charged with oral
OL,7,Frape, kidnap, strangulation and sexual
OL,8,Fassault, along with dangerous driving
OL,9,Foffences and the theft of a mobile
OL,10,Fphone.
OL,12,FGreater Manchester Police say he was
OL,13,Foff duty at the time of the offences.
OL,15,FA woman was also found at the scene of
OL,16,FHassan's arrest, who is being
OL,17,Fsupported by specialist officers.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/4
