PN,36103
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F361A1786425556
OL,3,CTrainee officer charged with rape and
OL,4,Ckidnap of woman
OL,6,FAssistant Chief Constable Mark Dexter
OL,7,Fsaid: "GMP detectives and staff have
OL,8,Fbeen working on this investigation
OL,9,Fthroughout the last 48 hours to ensure
OL,10,Fcharges are brought in this case.
OL,12,F"The victim is our priority, and we
OL,13,Fare ensuring she continues to receive
OL,14,Fspecialist support. Criminal
OL,15,Fproceedings must now take its course
OL,16,Fwithout interference.
OL,18,F"I understand, and share, the feeling
OL,19,Famong the public and our thousands of
OL,20,Fhard-working, decent staff who will
OL,21,Fhave seen this news.
OL,26,@oD@GOUtD@AOUzD@AOU
